                  >Full Roof Inspection & Maintenance</span
                >
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <svg
                  class="w-[18px] h-[18px] text-foreground shrink-0"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.8"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                >
                  <path
