            <p class="body-sm text-medium-gray mt-3 max-w-[620px]">
              We provide roofing solutions customized to meet your unique needs
              perfectly.
            </p>
            <ul
              class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4 sm:gap-8"
            >
              <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
